      "title": "",
      "description": "The view outside looks third world because the buildings look dirty. The weather is hard on them. The look is deceiving — the insides are well maintained.  The city infrastructure is top notch. The subway system goes every where, it’s clean and the trains come every 2 minutes. I timed them. ",
